==Trivia==
This card's effect is identical to that of the effect of the {{TCG|Rare Candy}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] from the Black & White Series onward.

===Origin===
* This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Rare Candy|129}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
* [[Rare Candy]] is an [[item]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that increases the [[level]] of the Pokémon it is given to by 1.

